### 3. Competitor Intelligence & Factual Verification
* **Target Competitor Analyzed:** CaratLane Engagement Ring Style PLP ([caratlane.com/jewellery/engagement+ringstyle.html](https://www.caratlane.com/jewellery/engagement+ringstyle.html))
* **Identified Content Gaps in Competitor:**
  1. *Corner Vulnerability & Setting Architecture:* CaratLane categorizes rings purely by visual silhouette without explaining why the four 90-degree pointed corners require protective V-shaped chevron prongs to mitigate cleavage plane shearing.
  2. *Facet Count & Diamond Yield Economics:* No discussion of pyramidal rough crystal yield (80% vs 40-50% for round brilliant diamonds) or how chevron tiers (2, 3, or 4) control scintillation speed.
  3. *Indian Purchasing Compliance:* Missing transparent statutory breakdown of 3% GST computation, mandatory 6-character alphanumeric BIS HUID hallmarks, and third-party laboratory verification (IGI, SGL, GIA).
* **Factual Standards Integrated:**
  * **BIS Hallmarking:** Mandatory 3 components (BIS Triangular Logo, Karatage & Fineness e.g., 750 for 18K / 585 for 14K, and laser-engraved 6-character alphanumeric HUID).
  * **Taxation:** Precise 3% GST calculation on total invoice value (gold metal value + diamond value + making charges).
  * **Diamond Certification:** Triple laboratory standards verified (SGL, IGI, GIA) covering color, clarity, polish, and symmetry grades.

